# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo, matching Konnekt's .gitattributes.
#
# This is not cosmetic here. design/tokens.json is byte-compared against each
# product's vendored copy by scripts/sync-tokens.sh, and the products normalize
# to LF. Without this, a Windows checkout leaves the source as CRLF and every
# comparison reports drift on a workspace that has none — invisible in CI, which
# runs on Linux. The scripts also strip CRs before comparing, so neither side
# alone has to be right.
* text=auto eol=lf
